                                                "example_id": "b471b862-3f21-45df-a49f-5c2f60c6c801",
                                                "sense_id": "717a7f6e-7678-3c84-b189-f624d073d62c",
                                                "text": "The first real meeting of the OAS was held in mid-May 1961. Its purpose was to sabotage de Gaulle’s efforts to remove French rule from Algeria."
